  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>改造前：</strong>清冷空荡的办公空间。</p>\n<p><strong>改造后：</strong>增加&ldquo;家&rdquo;的元素，实现一个空间的综合功能。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "92711f95764b4e1193683ba221737c71"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<p>▲罗罗的办公室空荡荡，没有适合孩子活动的舒适空间，就连办公也提不起兴趣，罗罗之前多选择在家办公，但与团队线上沟通，难免影响效率。</p>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/31/24/31241866e27f44534d63a1509a336f44.jpg",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/4b/f2/4bf21f36d31b496ad612822ad1960b57.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/31/24/31241866e27f44534d63a1509a336f44.jpg",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/4b/f2/4bf21f36d31b496ad612822ad1960b57.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "dcf9d3c538aa48c7b75602846272a82b"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<p>最大的一面墙体使用了普拉萨储物系列，充分利用垂直空间，凭空多出一整面的收纳空间，配搭柜门和内置收纳件，容量大、好分类，罗罗的日常用品和各类试用产品的收纳轻松搞定。较小的墙面则利用洞洞板展示照片，起到了很好的装饰作用。</p>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/03/ca/03ca249b43394344eca225e86be85310.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/03/ca/03ca249b43394344eca225e86be85310.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "1a1f3e2e7c024c739ef32d58eee05079"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "<p>工作之余，罗罗需要休息放松的地方，宝宝也需要尽情玩乐的场所。两位设计师特地在她的办公空间内打造了一个创意儿童区。精心挑选安全温馨的儿童家具，规划出大量儿童储物空间，为孩子的玩乐时光创造惊喜、舒适的体验。</p>",
    "pub-text",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/43/0e/430e7cf3eb4bc3890106d974923d102f.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/43/0e/430e7cf3eb4bc3890106d974923d102f.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "c81045f52db44725982d9d82baf52bcd"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<p>&nbsp;小巧的儿童扶手椅贴合幼儿身形，与宽厚柔软的折叠坐垫并排安置，形成儿童阅读角，是罗罗闲时为孩子讲述绘本故事的理想地点。</p>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/96/a3/96a32a92be6520623b5849a53af42c7d.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/96/a3/96a32a92be6520623b5849a53af42c7d.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "c53366d4fc1e4bccbc9c3260bf126ed1"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<p>▲ 办公、看书、玩耍、绘画&hellip;&hellip;罗罗和孩子的需求都得到了实现。充满童趣创意的空间里，一半宁静安逸，一半活力满满，这些将一直陪着小七长大，成为&ldquo;家&rdquo;的另一种延伸形式，也让罗罗与孩子能共享美妙的亲子时光。</p>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/37/11/3711b134b9965736ce4159385f9e7643.jpg",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/66/4a/664a70bf251ccd0ca8ae994da826135b.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/37/11/3711b134b9965736ce4159385f9e7643.jpg",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/66/4a/664a70bf251ccd0ca8ae994da826135b.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "0904a86ac2224331a9174d094dedadd6"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<p>当罗罗想要一个人放松独处时，窗边的沙发便是个舒服的休憩角落，用来陪孩子玩耍、哄孩子午睡也是恰到好处。踏脚凳温暖质朴，方便罗罗轻松拿取高处的物品，也可以充当孩子的小木桌置物。&nbsp;</p>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/b2/d5/b2d5c2d94eb1a127ece3a6413d974673.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/b2/d5/b2d5c2d94eb1a127ece3a6413d974673.jpg",
