  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>改造前：</strong>区域制式分割，界限感交流模式。</p>\n<p><strong>改造后：</strong>储物、隔断两不误，空间和交流双打通。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "f6bc16278d1f47138838bb568390ed79"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<p>▲ 罗罗的办公区一面为滑动玻璃门，空间上完全隔开了她与团队小伙伴的区域，也似乎不符合这个以交流沟通为主团队的气质。</p>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/2e/a1/2ea190a9733c006711bb3484a493943f.jpg",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/e2/b9/e2b99afeca9d4dfdc61b2f06295de971.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/2e/a1/2ea190a9733c006711bb3484a493943f.jpg",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/e2/b9/e2b99afeca9d4dfdc61b2f06295de971.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "f4a09edc1ac745acb1c3facc2c83d6ce"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<p>这种设计保留私密性，又不隔断罗罗与同事的沟通联系。双方的文件、平板电脑可以轻松传递，便于随时展开讨论，大大拉近了他们的沟通距离。</p>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/bd/47/bd4738d56aded6053c62db7776b62537.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
