  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>改造前：</strong>空间规划不合理，缺少专门的储物区，产品衣服裸露堆积。</p>\n<p><strong>设计思路：</strong>设置丰富的墙面储物方案，集中收纳更整洁。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "7cda9106472b4d9fb3ffdf55216e18e7"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<p>▲ 作为一位博主，罗罗经常要在办公室测评产品、搭配服装、拍摄视频。地上的书籍杂物和裸露的衣架，既压缩了可活动区域，也使得空间看起来杂乱无序。</p>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/07/05/0705cdc825be9981d6c56a9f1b634916.jpg",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/72/22/72226ee57b4c3425b5e0277f91f379a2.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/07/05/0705cdc825be9981d6c56a9f1b634916.jpg",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/72/22/72226ee57b4c3425b5e0277f91f379a2.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "4ff1745303d742b98d32fa1586596d21"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<p>温暖的木质墙搁板兼具储物和展示作用，可以放置生活小物件，也可以陈列各种书籍。当工作遇到瓶颈时，这里就成为了寻找灵感、查阅资料的理想场所。&nbsp;</p>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/38/96/3896c395af7953cfa79abae301d48a3d.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/38/96/3896c395af7953cfa79abae301d48a3d.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "e12350950f7942ee9a1330b40b9f89d8"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "<p>衣柜单元能同时收纳和陈列大量衣物，大人和孩子的衣物由高至低、层次分明地摆放，孩子可以自由取用衣物。更令人惊喜的是，原来不起眼的小角落，竟被开辟为一个小更衣室，隐蔽舒适，可以为更多私密需求服务。</p>",
    "pub-text",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/0e/c9/0ec9f14b28bcb42d6aa60f5334c8f414.jpg"
