   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>改造前：</strong>传统大尺寸办公桌，居中占地过多，刻板严肃空间感差。</p>\n<p><strong>改造后：</strong>简约木桌功能多变，办公、测评、用餐、美观皆担当。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "d14a9ba0b29d4ef38a9337b71c721d65"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<p>▲ 原本团队办公桌自带储物柜，但桌面仍显凌乱拥挤。厚重的体积，占用了较大室内空间。</p>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/15/fb/15fb30fbc770db1519ce0772a339c660.jpg",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/79/54/79544f09ab4dc4237f4026e1daf9169c.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
