    "traceId": "42bf815e2dee48b399efa4ec1992dc91"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<p>改造后的工作区域，多了一份在家办公的自在氛围。偶尔团队聚餐，或为同事庆生，只需稍微布置下，就能将办公桌变为餐桌，一起享用丰盛美食。</p>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/2c/88/2c8821b8cd0b85e73e531e3b51c2bc7f.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/2c/88/2c8821b8cd0b85e73e531e3b51c2bc7f.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
