   "settings": {
    "traceId": "3adece40c5594fe3844a4adffa22107d"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<p>▲ 办公室的尽头开辟了一块窗边休闲区。带脚轮长凳和软靠枕是理想拍档，既能提供安静思考的空间，又能物尽其用，增加收纳。</p>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/06/6e/066ee88aa9d5bc5730ac8d5bd0876ca7.jpg",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/54/f2/54f289ff8109b508616140810d5cb9d3.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
